{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"14148","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v5124","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"三鈴めい","creatorId":"vndb:s12753","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12753","name":"三鈴めい","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:88883","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c62692","characterName":"近藤 勇美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12654","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14376"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11492"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62692"},"originalCharacterName":"近藤 勇美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天燃理心流の使い手、剣豪。学園新閃組の局長。３年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖艶でエロいお姉様の容姿にもかかわらず、性知識は一切なく、常識外れの言動を連発。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道のもと、幼少から剣術と勉学にあけくれた結果、このような美少女が完成した！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本、体育会系なので、あっけらかんとして、さばけた性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が妖艶でエロいバディとは全く思っておらず、きわどい短パンで翼の前に登場することもしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"処女なのにセックス指南、この大いなる矛盾を乗り越えられるのか!?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘い物に目が無く、よくアイス片手に、剣を振っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11492","sourceWorkId":"14148","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天燃理心流的好手、剑豪。学园新闪组的局长。3年级学生，翼的前辈。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"尽管生就一副妖艳性感的御姐容貌，却没有任何性知识，偏离常识的言行屡见不鲜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在文武双全的方针指导下，从小时候开始就埋头于剑术和苦学的结果，这样一个美少女出炉了！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总的来说属于体育社团系，不拘小节，性格爽朗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对自己的妖艳性感身材完全没有自觉，穿着猥亵的热裤在翼眼前登场也是常有的事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明明是处女却要负责SEX指南，她能够克服这个巨大的矛盾么!?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对甜食喜欢得不得了，常常一手拿着冰激凌，一手挥剑。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12654"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0c28c791ac5b83b1e69f39781937b0c955ecf18fdd2c87b2b9215b53941b605.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13dd92d8ba304dd025e9e7da751ce16d8ec3f5559f53d8f4fd40b31965dd951f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山川琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1173","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1173","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1173","name":"山川 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14376:12654:4799:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62693","characterName":"土方 香里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12655","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14376"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11491"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62693"},"originalCharacterName":"土方 香里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目、文学美少女にしか見えない学校一の才媛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新閃組の副長。2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"痛いほどのツンツン毒舌女子であり、口から連発される言葉は翼の心をえぐりまくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マイペースで翼の都合などお構いなし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"帝胡桃以上に、近藤勇美を信奉しており、勇美が翼にセックス指南をすることがガマンならず、先輩がてーそーを失うくらいなら私が、と考えてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その一方で、猫が大好き。猫を見るとウズウズし、そこに向かって飛びかかってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情に応じて、猫耳のようなリボンがピコピコ動く、かなり変わった女の子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11491","sourceWorkId":"14148","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新闪组的副长。2年级学生，翼的同级生。文学系美少女，学园首屈一指的才女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"让人痛心疾首的光傲不娇的毒舌女子，从嘴里连续吐出的话语令翼的心伤痕累累。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"我行我素，也不管翼方不方便。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"比起帝胡桃，更信奉着近藤勇美，无法忍受勇美要对翼进行SEX指南一事，认为「与其让前辈失去贞操宁可由我来」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"爱猫成性。一看到猫就会蠢蠢欲动，恶女扑猫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"猫耳形状的缎带会随感情起伏而微微颤动，是个很古怪的女孩子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12655"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abddc4a2228eb87f1efe358022037387945c9f76f08c0f9dc5e66df57c938d92.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f6b82c478014ece412612476326b8da9c492e37c7352c94b5e163890dc39b50.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"計名 さや香","creatorId":"vndb:s859","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s859","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s859","name":"かずなさやか(計名さや香)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30741","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62694","characterName":"沖田 総実","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12656","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14376"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11494"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62694"},"originalCharacterName":"沖田 総実","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新閃組の切り込み隊長。１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気印のムードメーカー。明るく元気で、あどけない表情をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイドルを目指していることを公言しており、そのための努力を欠かさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"詰め所にカラオケ装置一式を置いて誰もいない時間には歌の練習をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恐い話、不思議な話は大好きで、幽霊討伐の旅に出たこともあり、ホラー映画好きの翼と話が合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛らしい容姿と、あどけない表情で、全校の学生にファン増殖中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すでに学園のアイドル的存在であるが、夢は大きくメジャーデビュー。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11494","sourceWorkId":"14148","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新闪组的突击队长。1年级学生，翼的后辈。精神象征的气氛搞手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"开朗活泼，表情天真无邪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明言想成为偶像，为此不惜努力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在值班室备置了一整套卡拉OK装置，没有其他人的时候会一个人练习唱歌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最喜欢恐怖故事、神神叨叨的故事，也曾参加过讨伐幽灵之旅，和喜欢恐怖电影的翼很合得来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凭借可爱容貌和清纯表情，以全校学生为受众，粉丝增殖中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"已经是学园偶像一般的存在了，但梦想要更为远大——正式出道。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12656"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14be2f9b5c42180012876820f72ffc0accb5c65095825aeb250e99aa5ff774f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33d323454329c66055d5879c1752dbda0be4f3b42adeeb41fd49061297aa8060.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14376:12656:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62695","characterName":"山南 敬子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12657","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14376"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11490"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62695"},"originalCharacterName":"山南 敬子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"色白で、優しく、暖かみのある穏和な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新閃組の会計方（経理）を担当。3年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏和で暖かな性格で、翼のオアシス的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翼の悩み事をいつも聞いて、アドバイスをしてくれる優しいお姉様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣術の腕はそれほどでもないが、情報こそが最重要と信じて疑わず、 新閃組メンバーの学園生活から私生活にいたるまで、全てを把握。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全員の弱みを握っているらしく、 近藤勇美にゆいいつ進言できる影の総長とも言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"腹黒系女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性に対しては非常に前向きで、女子力（じょしりょく）を高めるためにも、貞淑なだけでは駄目だと常々考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"唯一の欠点と言えるのがギャンブル好きであること。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"これが原因でトラブルになることがしばしば。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11490","sourceWorkId":"14148","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"皮肤白净、性格温柔、让人心生暖意的温和女子。担任新闪组的会计员（经理）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"3年级学生，翼的前辈。一直在倾听翼的烦恼、为他排忧解难的善良姐姐。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剑术水平虽然不怎么样，但坚信着情报才是最重要的，从新闪组成员的学园生活以至私生活，事无巨细一一把握。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貌似捏有全员的把柄，据说是唯一能够向近藤勇美进言的影之总长。 腹黑系女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在性方面非常开放，为了提高女子力 （じょしりょく），经常考虑着光靠立贞节牌坊那显然是不行的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"唯一称得上是缺点的只有喜欢赌博一事。因此而惹来麻烦的事也屡有发生。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12657"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0dd7cc5b7393de7487d9aa51188c050be8ff53743aa7a32483901d93c5149746.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b892c44d21d57ca69553a05b7f7859f2e1c174ceaae59b323ec7e23e098b90d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"西沢 広香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14376:12657:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62696","characterName":"威斎 一磨","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12658","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14376"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11493"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62696"},"originalCharacterName":"威斎 一磨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"沖田と同じく新閃組の切り込み隊長。2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙で言葉は少ないが、剣の腕は新閃組でも随一と言われている使い手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸が発育とともに最近大きくなってきて、剣が振りにくくなったことをかなり気にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷静沈着、動かざること山のごとしで、何事にも動じない美少女だが、ホラーが極めて苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"総実が得意げにホラーを話しはじめると、顔面が蒼白になり、発汗しまくってその場で気絶することも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何とか恐い話を克服せんと、翼にホラー指南を頼み、教えを請いにくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新閃組の中で彼女の素性だけは一切不明。局長の勇美ですら詳しいことを知らない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11493","sourceWorkId":"14148","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"和沖田一样是新闪组的突击队长。2年级学生，翼的同级生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"沉默寡言，据说剑术水平在新闪组也是首屈一指的强者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近胸部开始发育，很在意着越来越不方便挥剑一事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷静沉着、不动如山，泰山崩于前而色不变的美少女，但极其害怕恐怖片。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"総実一开始得意地说起恐怖片的话题脸色就会变得苍白，大汗淋漓，有时甚至还会当场晕倒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为了想办法克服恐怖话题而拜托翼进行恐怖片指南，向他请教而来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新闪组之中只有她的来历完全不明。连局長勇美都不知道详情。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12658"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/535b52a38d5875f0aab2e4c77eafbf7fc4ce3df954765de20535fb14b3ac12c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/722aa2372936ff050259cb9d8a00371da6c8c60ee8ef0b03564d870cd6cc883c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日アン(春乃うらら)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14376:12658:6480:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62697","characterName":"帝 胡桃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12659","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14376"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11495"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62697"},"originalCharacterName":"帝 胡桃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の学生筆頭（学園公認）を務める理事長の孫娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"御所学園２年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の許婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新閃組は彼女の護衛として存在し、帝は新閃組に絶対の信頼を置いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとしていて、世間ずれしていない、可憐な美少女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11495","sourceWorkId":"14148","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"担任学园学生代表（学园公认）的理事长孙女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"御所学园2年级学生。主人公的未婚妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新闪组作为她的护卫队而存在，她则对新闪组置以绝对的信赖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格文雅，天真无邪、楚楚可怜的美少女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12659"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/740cce4893a47bd7df2a4b6c62b76511bff137b46178c5a967cb07902b1b8b50.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e869e55a35cc386b9742a13fbd59fbe81b580ee79434733499f9e3797d20b5b5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山名枝里子","creatorId":"vndb:s17301","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17301","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17301","name":"山名 枝里子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14376:12659:16083:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"桜城 ちか","creatorId":"vndb:s1174","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1174","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1174","name":"月ヶ瀬 あかね","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30743","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62698","characterName":"坂本 竜子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12660","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14376"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11496"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62698"},"originalCharacterName":"坂本 竜子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、御所学園の学生自治会「開援隊」（学園非公認団体）の会長を務める。３年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園は学生が治めるもの、というポリシーを信じ、民主化運動をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理事長の孫娘というだけで、学生の代表に就いている胡桃を良く思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"選挙によって学生代表を選ぶべきと説き、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧態依然とした学園において学生自治を進めるべく活動している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それゆえ、新閃組の行動に対しては、ことあるごとに反発している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11496","sourceWorkId":"14148","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"担任御所学园的学生自治会・开援队（学园非公认团体）现任会长的3年级学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"坚信学园应当由学生自治的政策，推行着民主化运动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对只凭理事长孙女这一身份就任学生代表的胡桃很是不以为然。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"四处宣传学生代表应当由选举产生，为了在因循守旧的学园推行学生自治而活动着。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此，对新闪组的行动有事没事都要加以反对。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12660"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c1ebb7ca97bc44f16cd8f40e110ae40ca5ec007d0e8c0261088a3116f125f6b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3aff46884285a074ed052b79f790f1d11b23ed09ab173c0f324e5ac33b5d79f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"那姫 しずな","creatorId":"vndb:s14181","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14181","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14181","name":"那姫 しずな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30744","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c62691","characterName":"美田 翼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c62691"},"originalCharacterName":"美田 翼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p337","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:845","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p337","name